wifi-bt-host-driver (the "Package") is the RT-Thread driver package for
Aerolynq CYWL-series WiFi/Bluetooth modules, which Aerolynq builds on
Infineon WiFi and Bluetooth chips. It is built on Infineon's WiFi
Host Driver (WHD), the BTStack host-side integration and the RTOS
abstraction layer.

